            "review_title": "Review at Vien bar and restaurant",
            "review_text": "Миша\nZelenograd, Russia12 contributions\n0\nMagnificent place\nJun 2026 • Couples\nIt's a very nice restaurant! \nMy husband and I take our 2nd week off and come here regularly for either lunch or dinner. \nHere you can find different foods on the menu, for all tastes. We tried half the menu and the bar, and here's what we want to say. It's delicious here! Cooking with soul, staff excellent, friendly, responsive. \nCocktails are a separate work of art. \nThe cocktails here are delicious, the serving is beautiful. \nThe interior of the restaurant is pleasant, and there is always good music. \nCome here for a nice meal, you won't regret it.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten June 18, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
